  "invariants": [
    "An unresolved potential match always holds release; only a human dispositions a potential match",
    "No AI output and no non-compliance role can confirm a match, dispose a match as false positive or release blocked property",
    "A list update rescreens every unreleased payment chain and every Outstanding check before its next transition",
    "Blocked property never moves, retries, reissues or restores capacity without licence or delisting evidence and independent compliance authority",
    "Every screening decision and report is retained for at least 10 years (RCD-007)"
  ]
